WEBVTT

01:13.740 --> 01:18.220
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.300 --> 01:23.460
[Episode 35]

01:44.359 --> 01:47.359
He always mollycoddles me
with these weird things.

01:47.879 --> 01:49.719
Does he think I'm a kid?

02:24.159 --> 02:27.399
♫ I've been alone ♫

02:27.599 --> 02:30.758
[Where can you find
such a big buyer like me now?]

02:30.759 --> 02:38.119
♫ And navigate through the dark ♫

02:38.519 --> 02:45.558
♫ I'm searching for a meadow of mine ♫

02:45.559 --> 02:52.358
♫ till you came in with the breeze ♫

02:52.359 --> 02:55.398
♫ I feel it rushes over me ♫

02:55.399 --> 02:59.559
♫ Spills my heart into the field ♫

03:02.319 --> 03:04.919
[Receiving a ring
for the second time in my life]

03:09.559 --> 03:11.079
The second time?

03:18.239 --> 03:21.119
[Who gave a ring to you the first time?]

03:42.079 --> 03:42.998
I mean it.

03:42.999 --> 03:44.918
I really can't stand my dad.

03:44.919 --> 03:46.039
You know?

03:46.879 --> 03:49.198
If I post what he did on the Internet,

03:49.199 --> 03:51.919
he'll receive more than 3,000 bad comments.

03:52.679 --> 03:54.159
Take Cuo Bazi for example.

03:54.639 --> 03:56.278
I told him in the beginning
that I wouldn't walk it.

03:56.279 --> 03:58.079
He's the owner.
He should be the one who walks it.

03:58.399 --> 04:01.239
And then my dad
did throw it out.

04:01.559 --> 04:03.838
But when he threw the dog down the hallway,
he said,

04:03.839 --> 04:06.119
"Your sister doesn't want you."

04:06.359 --> 04:08.119
I felt myself suffocating.

04:08.519 --> 04:09.558
How nice that is!

04:09.559 --> 04:11.278
Other kids want to raise a dog,

04:11.279 --> 04:12.798
but their parents won't let them.

04:12.799 --> 04:14.079
You know what?

04:14.399 --> 04:17.199
When I was little,
I raised two rabbits.

04:17.599 --> 04:20.039
My sister hated them.

04:20.599 --> 04:22.439
Have you seen rabbit poop?

04:22.719 --> 04:23.919
Those round pellets.

04:25.439 --> 04:26.958
Isn't it a dollop?

04:26.959 --> 04:28.318
No.

04:28.319 --> 04:30.078
A little smaller than sheep droppings.

04:30.079 --> 04:31.319
Like puff balls.

04:31.599 --> 04:34.518
If you are near-sighted,
you'll think

04:34.519 --> 04:35.879
they're chocolate beans.

04:37.159 --> 04:38.558
I'm a big fan of chocolate.

04:38.559 --> 04:41.519
This metaphor gives
me a strong image.

04:43.399 --> 04:44.519
By the way, Hongdou,

04:44.799 --> 04:46.678
we saw what you posted on WeChat Moments

04:46.679 --> 04:49.398
that this is the second time
you've received a ring.

04:49.399 --> 04:50.719
So

04:50.999 --> 04:52.839
When was the first time?

04:56.959 --> 04:58.119
Is there a story?

04:59.359 --> 05:00.559
There is.

05:05.599 --> 05:07.759
But it's not the kind of story you think it is.

05:10.759 --> 05:12.479
The first person who gave me a ring

05:15.199 --> 05:16.519
was my best friend.

05:17.519 --> 05:18.959
Her name is Chen Nanxing.

05:23.159 --> 05:24.839
We went to college together.

05:25.519 --> 05:26.639
And we were roommates,

05:26.919 --> 05:28.479
being with each other for four years.

05:30.119 --> 05:31.599
Then we both stayed in Beijing,

05:33.359 --> 05:34.879
and supported each other.

05:37.239 --> 05:38.839
We'd been friends for more than ten years.

05:42.479 --> 05:44.438
Now you own a homestay here.

05:44.439 --> 05:45.519
Tell her to come someday.

05:46.719 --> 05:47.799
She can't come.

05:48.159 --> 05:49.198
She's busy with work and has no holidays?

05:49.199 --> 05:50.199
No, no.

05:50.559 --> 05:52.079
She died last year.

06:02.479 --> 06:03.479
Sorry.

06:04.839 --> 06:05.839
It's fine.

06:07.439 --> 06:10.759
Actually,
I really want to tell you about this.

06:11.599 --> 06:12.599
Because

06:12.919 --> 06:14.399
you're my dear friends.

06:15.879 --> 06:18.319
I hope she can live on

06:18.759 --> 06:19.839
in another way.

06:22.039 --> 06:25.119
Every time her name is mentioned,
or

06:26.639 --> 06:27.759
her stories

06:29.719 --> 06:32.839
are circulating among us, then

06:34.399 --> 06:35.399
she will

06:35.879 --> 06:36.879
always exist.

06:37.439 --> 06:38.759
Why am I crying again?

06:39.559 --> 06:40.438
I'm sorry.

06:40.439 --> 06:42.039
Xie Zhiyao told me this.

06:42.719 --> 06:44.158
I'm not sure if I said it correctly.

06:44.159 --> 06:45.159
Probably so.

06:49.119 --> 06:50.679
I understand.

06:52.559 --> 06:55.399
Now she exists here.

06:56.519 --> 06:57.759
Chen...

06:58.599 --> 06:59.838
Chen Nanxing.

06:59.839 --> 07:00.839
Nanxing.

07:06.199 --> 07:07.599
It means the southern pole star.

07:08.919 --> 07:10.079
No, no, no.

07:10.479 --> 07:11.879
It means rhizoma arisaematis.

07:13.079 --> 07:17.719
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

07:20.519 --> 07:25.199
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

07:27.959 --> 07:34.079
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

07:34.439 --> 07:39.519
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

07:52.279 --> 07:53.279
Nana.

07:54.159 --> 07:55.279
You're still asleep?

08:02.439 --> 08:03.679
What's wrong, Mr. Ma?

08:04.519 --> 08:05.599
I'm going to leave.

08:06.559 --> 08:07.759
Keep this.

08:11.959 --> 08:14.239
A master gave it to me.

08:14.999 --> 08:17.478
It turns ill luck into good,
and calamities into blessings.

08:17.479 --> 08:18.599
Remember to keep it well.

08:21.719 --> 08:23.039
Nana, well,

08:23.479 --> 08:24.759
keep an open mind.

08:26.119 --> 08:27.759
Walk when you can't run.

08:28.079 --> 08:30.199
And when you can't walk,
meditate.

08:30.919 --> 08:32.199
Some mountains are just meant to be climbed.

08:35.839 --> 08:37.039
I can tell you haven't woken up.

08:37.479 --> 08:38.598
Go back to sleep.

08:38.599 --> 08:39.599
I'm leaving.

08:57.199 --> 08:58.519
Thank you, Mr. Ma.

09:08.279 --> 09:10.518
When we came out from there,
he still looked sleepy.

09:10.519 --> 09:11.519
Who's that?

09:11.679 --> 09:12.838
Where is this place?

09:12.839 --> 09:14.318
Impossible.

09:14.319 --> 09:16.678
Whoever he is,
you stayed up all night again.

09:16.679 --> 09:17.279
It was you.

09:17.279 --> 09:17.799
Really?

09:17.799 --> 09:18.119
Yeah.

09:18.120 --> 09:19.438
Alright, stop talking about me.

09:19.439 --> 09:21.238
Your ex-boyfriend from college

09:21.239 --> 09:23.319
screamed your name outside your dorm

09:23.959 --> 09:24.958
in the middle of the night.

09:24.959 --> 09:26.638
He lit the candles downstairs,
right?

09:26.639 --> 09:27.319
Yeah, yeah.

09:27.319 --> 09:28.119
He also lit the candles.

09:28.119 --> 09:28.839
Enough about that.

09:28.839 --> 09:29.439
Enough.

09:29.440 --> 09:30.598
And my girlfriend.

09:30.599 --> 09:33.879
Your ex-boyfriend also did the...

09:34.199 --> 09:35.319
Which one are you talking about?

09:40.919 --> 09:42.279
Hu.

09:43.839 --> 09:44.959
You're back.

09:45.519 --> 09:46.679
Going to kindergarten?

09:47.839 --> 09:50.159
These two are your friends?

09:50.639 --> 09:52.039
My college classmates.

09:53.359 --> 09:54.559
Let me introduce.

09:54.919 --> 09:57.679
This is Hu Youyu, my neighbor.

09:57.959 --> 10:01.158
He sings in the bar every night,
and he sings very well.

10:01.159 --> 10:02.158
Hello, Hu.

10:02.159 --> 10:02.559
Hi, Hu.

10:02.559 --> 10:03.495
Hello.

10:03.519 --> 10:04.335
How about this?

10:04.359 --> 10:05.639
Let's go sing together. My treat.

10:06.399 --> 10:07.798
Well, maybe next time.

10:07.799 --> 10:09.038
We'll take a road trip to Meili

10:09.039 --> 10:10.439
to see the sunset in the snow mountain.

10:10.639 --> 10:11.575
Right.

10:11.599 --> 10:13.879
Do you think Li Jianfeng
will come if I ask him out?

10:14.279 --> 10:16.959
Tell him Bai Manjun is here,
and he'll definitely come.

10:17.279 --> 10:18.118
You're right.

10:18.119 --> 10:18.998
Nonsense.

10:18.999 --> 10:20.158
I'm going to text him.

10:20.159 --> 10:20.759
Come on.

10:20.759 --> 10:21.119
Yeah, yeah.

10:21.120 --> 10:22.078
Let me take a look.

10:22.079 --> 10:22.799
Don't.

10:22.800 --> 10:23.878
Don't text him.

10:23.879 --> 10:25.038
This isn't over.

10:25.039 --> 10:26.678
He told me the other day

10:26.679 --> 10:28.558
that he remembered everything
happened between you.

10:28.559 --> 10:29.758
He's still single.

10:29.759 --> 10:31.238
Isn't that because of you?

10:31.239 --> 10:32.078
Yep.

10:32.079 --> 10:33.438
What does it have to do with me?

10:33.439 --> 10:33.719
Do you remember?

10:33.720 --> 10:34.598
When we were in college...

10:34.599 --> 10:35.399
Don't talk nonsense.

10:35.400 --> 10:36.398
He gave you a love letter.

10:36.399 --> 10:37.479
Yeah.

10:37.799 --> 10:38.918
I wrote the letter for him.

10:38.919 --> 10:39.998
What did it say in the letter?

10:39.999 --> 10:41.918
That's enough, you two.

10:41.919 --> 10:44.919
A strand of your hair swept my cheek.

10:45.479 --> 10:47.999
I don't want to use non-slip
mats in the shower room.

10:48.359 --> 10:49.439
I want this.

10:49.639 --> 10:51.319
Wooden tread. Made of antiseptic wood.

10:53.679 --> 10:55.358
This will do, too.

10:55.359 --> 10:56.798
But it's not easy to clean.

10:56.799 --> 10:58.398
Yeah, we have to take it out every time.

10:58.399 --> 11:00.239
But it's a lot more comfortable to step on it.

11:01.599 --> 11:02.358
OK, let's use this.

11:02.359 --> 11:03.958
I'll take the measurement
and then let you know.

11:03.959 --> 11:04.959
OK.

11:09.719 --> 11:11.359
Why didn't you reply to my message?

11:12.679 --> 11:13.718
Where are you going?

11:13.719 --> 11:15.439
Aren't you supposed to be shopping?

11:15.639 --> 11:16.998
I just got back from the horse ranch.

11:16.999 --> 11:18.559
I'll go after I send Lil Cute home.

11:19.039 --> 11:20.119
Well, then go.

11:20.679 --> 11:22.998
Xiaochun is unloading at the warehouse today.

11:22.999 --> 11:24.238
Xin's alone in the cafe.

11:24.239 --> 11:24.839
She needs help.

11:24.840 --> 11:26.038
I'm going to help her.

11:26.039 --> 11:27.879
Why didn't you reply to my message?

11:28.799 --> 11:30.678
I was drinking with Nana in her room last night,

11:30.679 --> 11:31.839
and my phone was charging.

11:33.399 --> 11:34.879
But you didn't reply to me this morning.

11:35.879 --> 11:36.958
Because I did it on purpose.

11:36.959 --> 11:37.959
Why ask?

11:39.119 --> 11:40.479
Why didn't you reply?

11:40.799 --> 11:42.439
Who gave you a ring the first time?

11:43.599 --> 11:44.719
I'm not going to tell you.

11:45.039 --> 11:47.358
I'll make you feel anxious,
worried, struggling

11:47.359 --> 11:48.679
and agitated.

11:49.039 --> 11:52.398
This is how I felt yesterday
when you said Nana

11:52.399 --> 11:54.318
helped you sell goods
on livestream.

11:54.319 --> 11:55.599
You're going to experience it, too.

11:56.799 --> 11:57.079
No.

11:57.080 --> 11:59.119
Why are you still holding a grudge?

11:59.399 --> 12:00.638
Just tell me.

12:00.639 --> 12:01.239
I won't.

12:01.239 --> 12:01.919
I'm busy.

12:01.919 --> 12:02.519
Take care.

12:02.519 --> 12:03.158
Bye.

12:03.159 --> 12:04.718
And you called me childish.

12:04.719 --> 12:06.119
Aren't you more childish than me?

12:06.479 --> 12:09.038
You're hanging around
on a horse in the day,

12:09.039 --> 12:10.958
and I didn't say you're a showoff.

12:10.959 --> 12:12.999
It's not like there are no
modern means of transportation.

12:14.679 --> 12:15.879
You're the big baby.

12:16.159 --> 12:17.478
A grass ring?

12:17.479 --> 12:18.719
Do you think you can fool me with that?

12:19.999 --> 12:21.559
Then how about I give you money?

12:22.079 --> 12:23.478
Make some money first.

12:23.479 --> 12:25.038
Look at how smug you feel.

12:25.039 --> 12:27.039
Riding a white horse
in the streets during the day.

12:27.279 --> 12:29.039
I'm doing this to see you.

12:29.279 --> 12:30.598
I'm going to Baoshan on business

12:30.599 --> 12:31.159
and stay there for one night.

12:31.159 --> 12:32.159
I'm not coming back tonight.

12:32.839 --> 12:35.079
Then you and Daxia look out on your way.

12:37.559 --> 12:38.959
How clingy.

12:43.119 --> 12:44.318
Chen Nanxing gave me the ring.

12:44.319 --> 12:45.519
Chen Nanxing.

13:08.079 --> 13:09.079
Be careful, it's hot.

13:12.999 --> 13:13.599
No way.

13:13.600 --> 13:14.718
Are these people crazy?

13:14.719 --> 13:16.278
Shall we unplug the phone?

13:16.279 --> 13:17.639
We did it yesterday, didn't we?

13:18.799 --> 13:21.119
I saw it was unplugged this morning,
so I plugged it.

13:25.519 --> 13:26.679
Hello?

13:28.679 --> 13:29.918
Sorry.

13:29.919 --> 13:30.959
We don't know this person.

13:44.199 --> 13:45.199
Your refreshments.

13:45.559 --> 13:47.359
When you finish the tea,
you can ask us for a refill.

13:49.479 --> 13:51.359
Is Singer Nana doing fine?

13:51.919 --> 13:53.159
She's doing fine.

13:53.719 --> 13:55.959
This year,
she's been working as a waitress here?

13:57.599 --> 13:59.839
Do you want some
honey in the tea?

14:00.719 --> 14:01.398
No, thanks.

14:01.399 --> 14:02.039
No?

14:02.039 --> 14:03.079
Then please enjoy.

14:07.159 --> 14:09.438
The hero is too weak.

14:09.439 --> 14:11.638
He's waiting for the heroine to rescue him?

14:11.639 --> 14:13.958
I don't want to read it anymore.

14:13.959 --> 14:16.519
Was the author's brain eaten by zombies?

14:17.479 --> 14:18.958
Why is he weak?

14:18.959 --> 14:21.639
They're a team against all the enemies.

14:22.799 --> 14:25.558
The heroine was disgraced.

14:25.559 --> 14:28.238
Is Barley Tea ugly-looking?

14:28.239 --> 14:29.438
She just wants to take her revenge on society.

14:29.439 --> 14:30.278
It's hard to imagine the scene.

14:30.279 --> 14:31.958
It's horrible. Stop writing.

14:31.959 --> 14:33.439
What is the matter with him?

14:34.119 --> 14:35.119
And this one.

14:35.319 --> 14:37.158
There's too much foreshadowing.

14:37.159 --> 14:38.798
It's neither exciting nor sweet.

14:38.799 --> 14:40.398
Both the hero and heroine have exes.

14:40.399 --> 14:41.918
Is it even necessary?

14:41.919 --> 14:42.959
So gross.

14:44.559 --> 14:45.599
This is funny.

14:45.999 --> 14:48.758
Does the heroine's brain grow muscles?

14:48.759 --> 14:49.998
She's always fighting.

14:49.999 --> 14:51.878
Barley Tea has a record.

14:51.879 --> 14:53.079
She likes to celebrate violence.

14:53.559 --> 14:55.439
You like to celebrate violence?

14:57.199 --> 14:59.559
Don't read these awful comments to me, alright?

15:01.079 --> 15:03.958
These are mild comments.

15:03.959 --> 15:05.438
They're not awful.

15:05.439 --> 15:08.079
And they paid money
to read the chapters.

15:09.759 --> 15:12.758
Those awful reviews, complaints,

15:12.759 --> 15:14.358
and the comments saying they want me dead,

15:14.359 --> 15:15.759
I didn't read them at all.

15:17.999 --> 15:18.999
I know.

15:19.359 --> 15:21.119
But I just have this feeling

15:22.079 --> 15:23.719
that's hard to describe.

15:30.079 --> 15:31.079
Nana.

15:31.559 --> 15:32.518
I'm going to tell you something,

15:32.519 --> 15:33.799
but you can't get mad at me.

15:34.199 --> 15:35.199
What is it?

15:38.879 --> 15:42.158
After I found out what happened to you,
I just feel

15:42.159 --> 15:44.959
our hearts became very, very close.

15:45.759 --> 15:50.238
We've seen the same
world and felt the weight

15:50.239 --> 15:52.398
of abuse and harassment.

15:52.399 --> 15:53.399
Right?

15:55.959 --> 15:57.559
You can sympathize with me, can't you?

15:57.999 --> 15:59.238
So can you.

15:59.239 --> 16:00.278
You helped me so much.

16:00.279 --> 16:02.159
Wasn't that because you felt sympathy?

16:04.239 --> 16:07.359
Well,
I just want to snap you out of it.

16:10.479 --> 16:11.559
So do I.

16:13.119 --> 16:16.278
So you should always believe
that when you get this done,

16:16.279 --> 16:19.719
you can get yourself
together and move on.

16:26.319 --> 16:27.639
Don't come over! Don't come over!

16:28.159 --> 16:29.159
It's Cuo Bazi.

16:35.119 --> 16:36.078
Hold it.

16:36.079 --> 16:37.079
Don't move.

16:45.919 --> 16:46.919
How do you feel?

16:48.679 --> 16:49.959
It feels soft.

16:53.759 --> 16:54.959
Let me touch it again.

17:04.639 --> 17:06.439
What... What is it...

17:06.759 --> 17:07.759
doing?

17:08.119 --> 17:11.278
The abdomen is the weakest part of a dog's body.

17:11.279 --> 17:12.838
This means it trusts you.

17:12.839 --> 17:15.119
It showed its weakest part to you.

17:17.039 --> 17:18.039
I can touch it?

17:26.759 --> 17:28.399
The belly feels softer.

17:31.159 --> 17:32.599
You're so amazing.

17:33.279 --> 17:34.279
Me?

17:35.359 --> 17:36.879
I think you're pretty amazing, too.

17:38.239 --> 17:39.599
I know what happened to you.

17:40.439 --> 17:42.838
You used the money you earned
doing live streaming on your birthday

17:42.839 --> 17:44.519
to help a fan who became sick,

17:44.799 --> 17:47.159
and made lots of
donations to Project Hope.

17:50.159 --> 17:51.078
It's nothing.

17:51.079 --> 17:52.679
Only a few tens of thousands of yuan.

17:54.839 --> 17:57.798
It's normal that
entrepreneurs donate

17:57.799 --> 17:59.998
tens of millions a day,
and the celebrities

17:59.999 --> 18:01.319
donate millions of yuan another day.

18:01.519 --> 18:02.838
We've seen too many of these things

18:02.839 --> 18:04.238
and it's like tens of thousands of yuan

18:04.239 --> 18:05.719
aren't worth mentioning.

18:06.599 --> 18:08.679
But actually,
you have no idea what you've done.

18:09.759 --> 18:11.159
At the school where my mother teaches,

18:11.399 --> 18:12.878
one thousand yuan can cover a child's tuition

18:12.879 --> 18:14.918
and living expenses for one year.

18:14.919 --> 18:17.158
One hundred thousand
yuan is enough for 30

18:17.159 --> 18:19.158
poverty-striken kids
to complete three years

18:19.159 --> 18:20.399
of compulsory education.

18:21.679 --> 18:23.918
30 kids.

18:23.919 --> 18:25.319
It's enough to form a class.

18:31.919 --> 18:34.038
It's not that we can't change the world.

18:34.039 --> 18:36.998
On the contrary,
everything we do

18:36.999 --> 18:39.159
is subtly changing the world.

18:39.799 --> 18:42.278
If we are more loving and caring,
the world

18:42.279 --> 18:43.679
will become better.

18:43.879 --> 18:46.079
If we're cold and unscrupulous,

18:46.959 --> 18:48.599
the world will become worse.

18:51.919 --> 18:55.279
I think Xinxin gives us a
reverse way of thinking.

18:56.119 --> 19:00.798
We often say we can't change the world,
but hope the world

19:00.799 --> 19:02.199
won't change us.

19:03.919 --> 19:05.879
But people are always changing.

19:06.639 --> 19:09.198
As we get older,
gain more experience,

19:09.199 --> 19:11.158
and meet more people,

19:11.159 --> 19:12.759
who can guarantee that we won't change?

19:17.159 --> 19:19.039
Cuo Bazi.

19:19.559 --> 19:20.558
Do you want to give it a hug?

19:20.559 --> 19:21.559
I don't dare to.

19:22.279 --> 19:23.399
Be brave.

19:25.199 --> 19:26.038
A big hug.

19:26.039 --> 19:27.039
Try it.

19:28.719 --> 19:29.719
Let me try.

19:30.719 --> 19:31.719
Come on.

19:35.319 --> 19:36.359
A big hug, a big hug.

19:42.039 --> 19:42.839
[Youfeng Cafe]

19:42.840 --> 19:44.998
Why did you choose this profession?

19:44.999 --> 19:46.119
Have you ever felt afraid?

19:46.599 --> 19:47.838
I'm fearless.

19:47.839 --> 19:50.599
Horror movies are my favorite types of movies.

19:51.119 --> 19:53.678
After you started to do this job,

19:53.679 --> 19:55.478
what was the largest change you've had?

19:55.479 --> 19:56.159
Hongdou.

19:56.160 --> 19:57.359
What are you watching?

19:59.719 --> 20:01.159
Imperfect Humans.

20:01.639 --> 20:02.958
I seem to have heard of it.

20:02.959 --> 20:04.239
Is it a variety show?

20:05.839 --> 20:06.999
A talk show.

20:07.519 --> 20:08.799
Which star is being interviewed?

20:09.319 --> 20:10.799
A mortician.

20:13.799 --> 20:14.839
Just a normal person.

20:15.559 --> 20:16.758
An ordinary person?

20:16.759 --> 20:18.519
Then this show must not be popular.

20:39.839 --> 20:41.199
The business card Hongdou gives you.

20:41.519 --> 20:43.998
She went to see President Xie's granny,

20:43.999 --> 20:45.999
and said she'd like you to think about it.

20:46.599 --> 20:47.879
What show is it?

20:49.359 --> 20:50.638
A talk show.

20:50.639 --> 20:52.119
But not a clout-chasing one.

20:56.199 --> 20:57.919
Why don't you check your email again?

20:58.399 --> 21:00.838
Hongdou said Xiaochun sent you

21:00.839 --> 21:02.879
the most precious thing in the world.

21:03.759 --> 21:04.799
What is it?

21:08.079 --> 21:09.559
A kind and gentle heart.

21:10.999 --> 21:11.999
Check it out.

21:54.999 --> 21:56.119
It's so awkward.

22:26.439 --> 22:27.439
Damai.

22:27.919 --> 22:29.039
Are you asleep?

22:30.679 --> 22:31.679
Not yet.

22:33.319 --> 22:34.359
Do you think

22:35.359 --> 22:37.119
it's a good idea

22:37.479 --> 22:38.479
that I do live streaming again?

22:39.399 --> 22:40.399
What do you want?

22:41.639 --> 22:42.639
I want to sing

22:42.999 --> 22:44.279
and help sell the products.

22:45.279 --> 22:48.918
But you'll get abused by the netizens
if you sell things online.

22:48.919 --> 22:50.398
I'm supporting the farmers and agriculture.

22:50.399 --> 22:52.318
I can sell the products in the village

22:52.319 --> 22:54.159
and help promote our place.

22:58.639 --> 22:59.719
You're not running away?

23:01.159 --> 23:02.159
Yeah.

23:02.959 --> 23:04.159
And you're not scared anymore?

23:06.039 --> 23:07.559
I'm scared.

23:08.479 --> 23:12.479
But you guys put shields on me.

23:12.839 --> 23:14.959
I now have thick shields

23:15.399 --> 23:17.639
that can withstand any kind of damage.

23:21.119 --> 23:22.319
Do you mean it?

23:24.119 --> 23:25.479
I've thought it through.

23:26.319 --> 23:30.159
I need to face my fears
and do something worthwhile.

23:34.759 --> 23:36.519
So what do you need me to do for you?

23:37.319 --> 23:38.599
Cheer for me.

23:38.959 --> 23:40.038
That's easy.

23:40.039 --> 23:41.038
Come on, come on, come on.

23:41.039 --> 23:41.759
Come on, come on.

23:41.759 --> 23:42.439
Come on, come on, come on.

23:42.439 --> 23:43.199
It's not enough.

23:43.199 --> 23:44.199
Not enough?

23:44.799 --> 23:46.198
Beware!

23:46.199 --> 23:49.798
Come on, come on, come on.

23:49.799 --> 23:50.678
Keep it down.

23:50.679 --> 23:51.958
Come on, come on, come on.

23:51.959 --> 23:53.038
Come on, come on.

23:53.039 --> 23:53.998
Come on, come on, come on.

23:53.999 --> 23:55.838
I can cheer for you
when I am lying down.

23:55.839 --> 23:57.598
It's the same when I'm standing up.

23:57.599 --> 23:59.679
Come on, come on, come on.

24:00.679 --> 24:01.638
I'm going to sleep.

24:01.639 --> 24:02.678
Come on, come on, come on.

24:02.679 --> 24:04.159
I'll cheer for you in my dream.

24:04.519 --> 24:06.479
Singer Nana is the best.

24:06.879 --> 24:09.598
[Youfeng Cafe]

24:09.599 --> 24:15.079
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

24:17.799 --> 24:19.638
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

24:19.639 --> 24:20.478
Nana.

24:20.479 --> 24:21.639
You came to work.

24:22.639 --> 24:24.318
I've been off for almost a week.

24:24.319 --> 24:25.438
There are lots of things to do here.

24:25.439 --> 24:27.358
And Hongdou's busy decorating our homestay.

24:27.359 --> 24:29.078
I can't let her work for me all the time.

24:29.079 --> 24:30.758
Great. I miss you so much.

24:30.759 --> 24:31.319
Nana.

24:31.319 --> 24:32.439
You want oil sticks?

24:32.839 --> 24:34.319
I've already had breakfast.

24:34.679 --> 24:35.558
Go to your work.

24:35.559 --> 24:36.559
Alright.

24:41.519 --> 24:43.039
Nana is back.

24:43.639 --> 24:44.159
Morning.

24:44.160 --> 24:46.039
Granny Xiuying, Granny Caiyun.

24:47.079 --> 24:48.798
How's your family?

24:48.799 --> 24:50.118
I didn't go home.

24:50.119 --> 24:51.798
A friend of mine came to visit.

24:51.799 --> 24:53.439
I just hung out with her for a few days.

24:54.439 --> 24:55.558
Granny Caiyun.

24:55.559 --> 24:56.958
I hope you haven't got tired these days.

24:56.959 --> 24:57.918
I haven't.

24:57.919 --> 24:59.799
I was just taking pictures with them.

25:00.319 --> 25:03.038
Taking pictures is not as
relaxing as sweeping the floor.

25:03.039 --> 25:05.118
You've become internet celebrities now.

25:05.119 --> 25:06.198
What is an internet celebrity?

25:06.199 --> 25:08.319
Someone who's very popular on the internet.

25:09.279 --> 25:12.519
She means you're popular
and many people like you now.

25:13.559 --> 25:13.999
That's great.

25:13.999 --> 25:14.999
Popular.

25:15.159 --> 25:15.959
It's good to be popular.

25:15.960 --> 25:16.798
We'll start to work.

25:16.799 --> 25:17.799
OK.

25:20.599 --> 25:25.079
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

25:27.959 --> 25:32.639
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

25:33.759 --> 25:34.558
Hello.

25:34.559 --> 25:35.199
Hello.

25:35.199 --> 25:36.199
Dropping people off?

25:37.879 --> 25:39.119
Lanzhi is back, too.

25:39.759 --> 25:40.398
Long time no see.

25:40.399 --> 25:41.238
Is everything alright?

25:41.239 --> 25:42.239
It is.

25:42.919 --> 25:44.039
I'm going to drop them off.

25:44.319 --> 25:45.518
Come over for a chat tonight.

25:45.519 --> 25:45.999
OK.

25:45.999 --> 25:46.519
OK, OK.

25:46.519 --> 25:47.199
Take care.

25:47.199 --> 25:47.839
See you.

25:47.840 --> 25:48.718
See you, uncle.

25:48.719 --> 25:49.879
Bye-bye.

25:52.479 --> 25:53.238
Dad.

25:53.239 --> 25:54.718
There are really more tourists now.

25:54.719 --> 25:56.879
Do you think my brother has actually made it?

25:57.879 --> 25:59.479
Can he make it alone?

25:59.799 --> 26:02.079
It should be the government
that made this happen.

26:03.119 --> 26:04.958
If you can't talk nicely, then don't.

26:04.959 --> 26:06.919
Those words were very offensive.

26:07.759 --> 26:08.759
Yuan.

26:08.959 --> 26:10.279
Aren't I a good talker?

26:10.599 --> 26:11.478
You aren't.

26:11.479 --> 26:12.719
That's it.

26:13.039 --> 26:14.679
Truth is hard on the ears.

26:15.599 --> 26:16.599
Watch out.

26:19.279 --> 26:21.758
We've redecorated the shower room

26:21.759 --> 26:23.518
according to your last request.

26:23.519 --> 26:26.518
But we want to achieve simplicity,

26:26.519 --> 26:28.878
so there are fewer decorative elements.

26:28.879 --> 26:32.118
Therefore,
we need to accentuate the room

26:32.119 --> 26:33.678
with soft furnishings.

26:33.679 --> 26:38.278
For example,
the sofa may need some cushions.

26:38.279 --> 26:40.198
And the dining table
needs tablecloth.

26:40.199 --> 26:40.519
Hongdou.

26:40.520 --> 26:41.719
And about the bed...

26:42.599 --> 26:43.199
I'll leave you two alone.

26:43.200 --> 26:44.359
Thank you.

26:46.439 --> 26:47.839
Come home for lunch.

26:48.399 --> 26:49.399
This is early.

26:49.999 --> 26:52.879
My dad, my aunt,
and Yuan are back.

26:53.199 --> 26:54.238
You haven't met my aunt.

26:54.239 --> 26:55.239
She's dying to see you.

26:57.039 --> 26:58.039
What's wrong?

26:59.279 --> 27:00.279
No.

27:01.319 --> 27:03.079
Is this an official meeting with your parents?

27:06.639 --> 27:07.999
Sort of.

27:08.559 --> 27:10.199
You think it's too abrupt?

27:10.599 --> 27:12.039
It is abrupt.

27:12.399 --> 27:13.679
Most importantly,

27:14.079 --> 27:15.599
I'm not mentally prepared,

27:15.879 --> 27:17.318
and I don't have any experience.

27:17.319 --> 27:19.438
What experience does this require?

27:19.439 --> 27:22.038
You've met my dad,
and you know Yuan.

27:22.039 --> 27:23.798
My aunt is a pretty nice person.

27:23.799 --> 27:25.478
She's just an ordinary housewife,

27:25.479 --> 27:26.919
but she may ask you more questions.

27:30.359 --> 27:31.398
I'm going to make a call.

27:31.399 --> 27:32.838
I need to call my sister and my mom.

27:32.839 --> 27:33.959
We'll have a video meeting.

27:34.399 --> 27:35.399
Meeting?

27:42.799 --> 27:44.598
The first time I went to
your brother-in-law's home,

27:44.599 --> 27:46.278
I just went there straight from work.

27:46.279 --> 27:47.399
I bought some fruit.

27:47.839 --> 27:51.238
They just want to know
what kind of person you are,

27:51.239 --> 27:52.918
what your family background is like.

27:52.919 --> 27:55.559
Well,
is there anything else I should be aware of?

27:56.199 --> 27:59.079
During the meal,
tell them how good the food tastes.

27:59.359 --> 28:01.318
And don't rush to wash the dishes.

28:01.319 --> 28:02.319
That's menial.

28:03.479 --> 28:04.759
Don't always play with your phone.

28:05.359 --> 28:07.118
Listen more and talk less.

28:07.119 --> 28:08.478
Keep smiling.

28:08.479 --> 28:09.479
Drink tea often.

28:09.599 --> 28:10.878
Got it, what else?

28:10.879 --> 28:11.758
No.

28:11.759 --> 28:13.518
It's not that complicated.

28:13.519 --> 28:15.799
Just go, Pikachu!

28:16.239 --> 28:16.958
Alright.

28:16.959 --> 28:17.999
Bulbasaur.

28:18.839 --> 28:19.478
Let's go.

28:19.479 --> 28:20.478
Go buy some fruit.

28:20.479 --> 28:21.758
I've already bought them.

28:21.759 --> 28:23.078
I just need you to come back with me.

28:23.079 --> 28:24.079
Don't be nervous.

28:24.399 --> 28:25.718
I'm not nervous.

28:25.719 --> 28:27.399
And you just had a video meeting?

28:28.239 --> 28:29.278
I was just filling them in.

28:29.279 --> 28:30.438
Fill them in?

28:30.439 --> 28:31.639
Why don't you feel me?

28:42.319 --> 28:43.638
Why are they still cooking?

28:43.639 --> 28:45.119
No, no, just sit down.

28:46.039 --> 28:47.039
Sit.

28:47.839 --> 28:49.158
My mom cares about you.

28:49.159 --> 28:50.238
Especially my mom.

28:50.239 --> 28:51.958
She thought my brother didn't want a girlfriend

28:51.959 --> 28:53.119
because he wanted to become a monk.

28:53.959 --> 28:54.959
Why?

28:55.519 --> 28:58.078
My brother used to have a friend,
whose kid has grown up.

28:58.079 --> 28:59.198
But suddenly he chose to become a monk.

28:59.199 --> 29:01.719
Now every time he sees us,
he'd say "Amitabha."

29:02.719 --> 29:03.719
Really?

29:03.759 --> 29:04.879
This is true.

29:05.399 --> 29:06.399
The fish is ready.

29:07.199 --> 29:07.679
Coming.

29:07.679 --> 29:08.679
Put it here.

29:09.639 --> 29:10.718
Move it over a bit.

29:10.719 --> 29:12.078
Be careful, it's hot.

29:12.079 --> 29:13.198
Auntie, stop cooking.

29:13.199 --> 29:14.118
We've got too many dishes.

29:14.119 --> 29:14.998
No more, no more.

29:14.999 --> 29:15.999
That's all.

29:18.879 --> 29:20.678
I asked Yao what do you like to eat,

29:20.679 --> 29:22.039
he said you'd eat everything.

29:22.599 --> 29:23.879
I do eat everything.

29:24.679 --> 29:25.798
Yeah, she's not a picky eater.

29:25.799 --> 29:26.559
She eats everything.

29:26.559 --> 29:27.559
That's nice.

29:27.839 --> 29:30.599
These are all her
signature dishes.

29:31.359 --> 29:33.838
Well,
my cooking skill isn't very good.

29:33.839 --> 29:35.798
I could only help your auntie out.

29:35.799 --> 29:36.478
Yeah.

29:36.479 --> 29:38.878
Your uncle was so well-behaved today.

29:38.879 --> 29:40.438
He offered to help me.

29:40.439 --> 29:42.318
In usual times,
he wouldn't even care

29:42.319 --> 29:43.799
if the soy bottle was tipped over.

29:44.079 --> 29:46.519
Luckily,
Yao and Yuan aren't like him.

29:47.079 --> 29:47.759
Hongdou's still here.

29:47.760 --> 29:49.399
Can't you spare my feelings?

29:50.239 --> 29:50.759
OK, OK.

29:50.760 --> 29:52.278
Let's not talk about him.

29:52.279 --> 29:52.878
Come on.

29:52.879 --> 29:53.639
Dig in.

29:53.640 --> 29:54.958
Let's eat, let's eat.

29:54.959 --> 29:56.318
Hongdou, start eating.

29:56.319 --> 29:57.359
Alright.

29:59.519 --> 30:00.559
Slow down.

30:00.959 --> 30:02.839
You're like a hungry ghost.

30:03.199 --> 30:04.599
I'm still growing.

30:05.359 --> 30:06.359
Come on.

30:06.719 --> 30:07.839
Thank you, uncle.

30:09.439 --> 30:10.439
Hongdou.

30:10.839 --> 30:13.959
Yuan talked about you a
lot when we were at home.

30:14.159 --> 30:16.758
He said a really nice
sister moved in the Yard.

30:16.759 --> 30:19.399
He wronged you and
you didn't get mad.

30:19.959 --> 30:20.895
Mom.

30:20.919 --> 30:22.039
Why did you bring this up?

30:22.559 --> 30:23.999
She's not saying something bad about you.

30:25.839 --> 30:27.838
Granny always tells me on the phone

30:27.839 --> 30:29.999
that Hongdou was accompanying her at the booth,

30:30.199 --> 30:32.359
or Hongdou was
chatting with her.

30:32.679 --> 30:34.999
Hongdou even bought her toys.

30:35.279 --> 30:38.119
She likes you very much,
right, mom?

30:39.079 --> 30:39.918
Yeah.

30:39.919 --> 30:41.839
She phoned us the other day to say

30:42.079 --> 30:43.679
you got together.

30:44.759 --> 30:46.919
All of us were thrilled.

30:47.959 --> 30:48.519
Hongdou.

30:48.520 --> 30:49.638
Here's a toast to you.

30:49.639 --> 30:50.199
Thank you, auntie.

30:50.200 --> 30:51.078
I wish you and Yao all the best

30:51.079 --> 30:53.238
for your careers and relationship.

30:53.239 --> 30:54.399
Good luck.

30:55.119 --> 30:56.519
Thank you, auntie and uncle.

30:56.759 --> 30:58.318
Don't worry.

30:58.319 --> 30:59.639
I will treat him well.

31:00.559 --> 31:01.838
You said it yourself.

31:01.839 --> 31:03.959
If you don't treat me right,
I'll call my aunt.

31:05.079 --> 31:07.838
If Hongdou treats you badly,
you should reflect on yourself.

31:07.839 --> 31:08.958
How can you tell on her?

31:08.959 --> 31:09.959
Right.

31:10.359 --> 31:11.198
Exactly.

31:11.199 --> 31:13.438
She won't treat you badly for no reason.

31:13.439 --> 31:14.439
Yeah.

31:14.639 --> 31:17.959
Now to all of you,
I'm like spilled water, right?

31:19.279 --> 31:20.518
Do what you got to do.

31:20.519 --> 31:21.079
Of course.

31:21.080 --> 31:22.839
The water is all over me.

31:24.279 --> 31:25.478
Let's eat.

31:25.479 --> 31:26.598
Have some vegetables.

31:26.599 --> 31:27.839
Thank you.

31:28.079 --> 31:29.118
Eat whatever you like.

31:29.119 --> 31:30.158
If you don't like it, put it aside.

31:30.159 --> 31:31.159
OK.

31:33.839 --> 31:34.639
Granny, have some, too.

31:34.639 --> 31:35.319
Do you want fish balls?

31:35.319 --> 31:36.319
Let me get you a fish ball.

31:37.039 --> 31:38.078
Let me, let me.

31:38.079 --> 31:39.358
Eat mine, granny.

31:39.359 --> 31:40.359
OK.

31:40.479 --> 31:43.038
♫ With a slim figure ♫

31:43.039 --> 31:47.199
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep ♫

31:52.959 --> 31:54.438
I should go help them.

31:54.439 --> 31:55.758
Sit here.

31:55.759 --> 31:56.759
Drink your tea.

31:58.919 --> 31:59.919
Hongdou.

32:00.199 --> 32:01.199
Here come the fruits.

32:02.359 --> 32:03.359
Pick some yourself.

32:04.319 --> 32:05.319
Lanzhi.

32:05.679 --> 32:07.039
I'm going to visit Grandpa Yang.

32:07.359 --> 32:08.198
Going to drink?

32:08.199 --> 32:09.279
No.

32:14.279 --> 32:15.279
Only a little.

32:15.679 --> 32:16.638
Just go.

32:16.639 --> 32:17.558
Hongdou.

32:17.559 --> 32:18.079
Feel at home.

32:18.079 --> 32:18.479
OK, uncle.

32:18.479 --> 32:19.479
I'm heading out.

32:21.119 --> 32:23.358
He doesn't know any of
his neighbors in Kunming.

32:23.359 --> 32:24.838
That was a rough time for him.

32:24.839 --> 32:28.398
Every time he comes here,
we can't even see him at night.

32:28.399 --> 32:29.799
He's always making visits.

32:30.519 --> 32:31.519
Uncle.

32:32.119 --> 32:33.238
Look at this house.

32:33.239 --> 32:34.359
How wonderful.

32:34.639 --> 32:36.119
All furniture here are new.

32:37.799 --> 32:39.678
Deqing and his wife are filial.

32:39.679 --> 32:41.439
Why are you still clamoring for moving out?

32:41.839 --> 32:43.199
What do you want?

32:45.679 --> 32:46.478
Qing.

32:46.479 --> 32:47.078
Uncle.

32:47.079 --> 32:48.439
How are you doing in school?

32:48.759 --> 32:49.959
Not bad, uncle.

32:50.159 --> 32:51.799
Have you decided which college you wanna attend?

32:52.679 --> 32:54.519
I haven't, uncle.

32:55.319 --> 32:58.399
Ask Yao to find some
good schools for you.

32:58.799 --> 32:59.318
OK.

32:59.319 --> 32:59.918
Go.

32:59.919 --> 33:01.078
Tell your mom not to make any more dishes.

33:01.079 --> 33:02.079
It's enough.

33:03.839 --> 33:05.639
Go get your dad here
to have drinks with us.

33:05.999 --> 33:06.598
OK.

33:06.599 --> 33:07.599
Don't go.

33:08.439 --> 33:10.239
I dare him to come back.

33:10.479 --> 33:12.039
This scoundrel.

33:12.239 --> 33:13.118
Alright, alright.

33:13.119 --> 33:14.159
We won't let him come.

33:15.439 --> 33:16.318
Uncle.

33:16.319 --> 33:17.319
Come on.

33:17.479 --> 33:18.479
Let's drink.

33:19.479 --> 33:21.359
I haven't had a drink with you in a while.

33:28.159 --> 33:30.599
Why did Deqing ask you to come over?

33:32.479 --> 33:33.559
Not him.

33:36.039 --> 33:38.279
Yao has got
himself a girlfriend.

33:38.919 --> 33:39.798
Lanzhi hasn't met her yet.

33:39.799 --> 33:40.919
We came to see her.

33:41.479 --> 33:42.479
Girlfriend?

33:42.759 --> 33:43.718
Where's she from?

33:43.719 --> 33:44.719
From Beijing.

33:46.199 --> 33:48.119
His girlfriend bought

33:48.439 --> 33:50.199
the homestay under construction.

33:51.919 --> 33:52.919
Before,

33:53.479 --> 33:55.718
he'd been creating chaos
with Huang in the village.

33:55.719 --> 33:58.119
And now,
there's one more person.

33:58.999 --> 34:00.479
Once they're together,

34:00.679 --> 34:04.438
see what a mess they
made in the village.

34:04.439 --> 34:05.998
There's no longer peace.

34:05.999 --> 34:07.879
You just don't know.

34:08.239 --> 34:09.878
It's like they poked a hornets' nest.

34:09.879 --> 34:12.279
The people who
came are all tourists.

34:13.199 --> 34:15.079
Isn't it nice to have more visitors?

34:15.519 --> 34:16.558
On my way here,

34:16.559 --> 34:19.639
I saw lots of stalls set up
in front of the houses,

34:19.919 --> 34:22.319
selling tie-dyed
products and scarfs.

34:23.279 --> 34:24.279
Yeah.

34:24.319 --> 34:25.958
They're all doing business.

34:25.959 --> 34:26.958
Then who'll farm the land?

34:26.959 --> 34:28.199
What will we eat?

34:28.919 --> 34:30.239
We'll still need to farm the land.

34:30.879 --> 34:32.039
It's another income.

34:35.119 --> 34:36.119
Income?

34:36.479 --> 34:37.679
What income?

34:37.999 --> 34:40.118
They only see money now.

34:40.119 --> 34:41.119
Absurd.

34:46.399 --> 34:47.399
Uncle.

34:49.479 --> 34:52.319
When I was little,
my brother got sick.

34:53.319 --> 34:55.399
We had no money,
and had to borrow from you.

34:55.639 --> 34:56.359
You didn't have enough savings,

34:56.359 --> 34:57.159
so you helped us borrow money from others.

34:57.160 --> 34:58.439
It took us a lot of effort

34:58.879 --> 34:59.918
to scrape together the money.

34:59.919 --> 35:02.319
But the health care
systems weren't developed.

35:02.959 --> 35:03.959
My brother

35:06.719 --> 35:08.959
cost a lot of money,
and still didn't get cured.

35:09.759 --> 35:13.079
When I grew bigger,
I only remembered my family was poor.

35:14.999 --> 35:16.959
The conditions were bad before.

35:19.159 --> 35:20.198
Education hadn't become compulsory,

35:20.199 --> 35:22.039
we had to get people to chip in for schools.

35:23.039 --> 35:25.079
You let Deqing take the money,

35:25.559 --> 35:26.798
and drag me to school.

35:26.799 --> 35:28.198
I had disappointing grades,

35:28.199 --> 35:31.119
but at least I finished junior high.

35:32.679 --> 35:33.879
I'm not well-educated.

35:34.359 --> 35:36.119
My first wife and I

35:37.879 --> 35:40.559
wanted Yao to study hard

35:40.839 --> 35:41.959
and leave this village.

35:43.399 --> 35:45.119
He's just like his mom.

35:45.839 --> 35:48.998
He's got a useful brain,
went to a university,

35:48.999 --> 35:51.119
and found a well-paid job.

35:52.039 --> 35:56.399
His next generation
would finally live a good life.

35:58.839 --> 36:01.279
But he insisted on coming back.

36:03.439 --> 36:04.678
The first two years since he came back,

36:04.679 --> 36:06.159
I messed with him a lot.

36:07.279 --> 36:08.439
The Tie-dye Workshop in the Bai family

36:09.799 --> 36:12.318
was going broke,
and he took it over.

36:12.319 --> 36:13.799
I blocked the door and yelled at him.

36:14.879 --> 36:18.119
And then even the
police officers came.

36:20.599 --> 36:22.039
What a disgrace.

36:25.279 --> 36:28.879
But I thought at that time,
for the sake of his future,

36:29.119 --> 36:31.039
I had to do that even if
I embarrassed myself.

36:35.479 --> 36:36.479
Later,

36:36.679 --> 36:37.999
Lanzhi told me

36:39.159 --> 36:40.999
every generation is better
than the one that went before it.

36:41.999 --> 36:43.439
We haven't read much.

36:43.839 --> 36:46.639
But Yao went to college
and saw a bigger world.

36:46.919 --> 36:48.879
He doesn't see things the way we do.

36:49.079 --> 36:50.279
We have to trust him

36:50.799 --> 36:53.359
and ask for his advice
if we meet some trouble.

36:54.999 --> 36:55.999
Uncle.

36:56.159 --> 36:57.918
Most people of your
generation were farmers,

36:57.919 --> 36:58.919
and had little money.

36:59.479 --> 37:02.158
People of our generation
can emigrate to cities to work.

37:02.159 --> 37:03.438
Life has become much better.

37:03.439 --> 37:05.958
But the children and the elderly

37:05.959 --> 37:07.399
are all left behind at home.

37:08.479 --> 37:09.679
But look at the condition now.

37:09.879 --> 37:11.438
If we can have more visitors,

37:11.439 --> 37:13.399
all the family can stay at home

37:14.199 --> 37:15.839
and earn more money,

37:16.839 --> 37:17.839
that's excellent.

37:20.919 --> 37:21.919
Siping.

37:22.559 --> 37:24.479
What do you think will happen

37:25.559 --> 37:26.799
to our village?

37:30.279 --> 37:31.559
I don't know.

37:32.439 --> 37:34.079
I don't dare to imagine.

37:35.079 --> 37:36.878
A few years ago,
who would have thought about

37:36.879 --> 37:38.359
selling flowers on live streaming?

37:39.199 --> 37:41.238
The delivery services are fast.

37:41.239 --> 37:42.679
We don't even need to take cash with us.

37:44.999 --> 37:45.999
Uncle.

37:46.799 --> 37:50.159
We can't manage too many things in one lifetime.

37:50.559 --> 37:52.479
The world outside is changing fast.

37:53.159 --> 37:55.879
We should change our
thinking for our next generation

37:56.519 --> 37:58.279
and the generation after that.

37:58.799 --> 37:59.799
Right?

38:10.079 --> 38:11.239
Impressive, uncle.

38:13.279 --> 38:14.639
Granny, I should go.

38:21.519 --> 38:22.519
I want to take a flower.

38:23.119 --> 38:24.439
Let me remove the thorns for you.

38:36.839 --> 38:37.598
Here you are.

38:37.599 --> 38:39.159
I'll send it to you tomorrow when it's ready.

38:40.999 --> 38:42.639
Hongdou, wait.

38:47.159 --> 38:49.718
It's a little gift from me and Yao's dad.

38:49.719 --> 38:50.359
Take it, come on.

38:50.359 --> 38:51.079
No, no, no.

38:51.080 --> 38:51.918
No, no, no, no.

38:51.919 --> 38:53.078
Auntie, I can't take this.

38:53.079 --> 38:54.198
It's the first time we met.

38:54.199 --> 38:56.079
You have to take it.

38:56.679 --> 38:57.399
No, auntie.

38:57.400 --> 38:58.678
This is too much.

38:58.679 --> 39:00.198
Not much, take it.

39:00.199 --> 39:01.279
Just take it.

39:02.479 --> 39:03.358
Yao.

39:03.359 --> 39:06.278
After you walk Hongdou home,
go pick up your dad.

39:06.279 --> 39:07.518
He must have drunk a lot.

39:07.519 --> 39:08.455
OK.

39:08.479 --> 39:09.958
Thank you for today, auntie.

39:09.959 --> 39:11.278
The food is very delicious.

39:11.279 --> 39:13.398
I'll teach Yao to cook
the dishes you like.

39:13.399 --> 39:14.759
He'll make them for you.

39:15.519 --> 39:16.519
Let's go.

39:16.719 --> 39:17.158
OK.

39:17.159 --> 39:17.958
Good night.

39:17.959 --> 39:18.959
Bye.

